# Root-level Docker build context guard (compose builds use ./backend and
# ./frontend contexts, each with their own .dockerignore; this protects any
# future root-context build from shipping secrets or local state).
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.log
.arena
scratch
frontend/dist
DEPLOYMENT_CHECKLIST.md
